{{!-- "Behind the paywall right now" — three teasers for posts a free reader cannot finish.

	{{> "membership/locked"}}

The strongest argument a membership page has is the writing it is holding back, and every one of
these is a real post: `filter="visibility:-public"` is the whole query, so the section shows what
is genuinely gated today rather than three titles a template remembered.

`visibility`, never the deprecated `page`/`status` pair — the same rule post/gate.hbs follows. The
chip prints Ghost's own word for the level through tier-chip.hbs, so a post open to a named list
of tiers prints the list rather than a word the theme invented.

`{{#if locked}}` and not the get's `{{else}}`: get calls `options.inverse` only for an invalid
resource or an API error, so a publication that gates nothing would otherwise render a heading, a
rule and 24px of padding around an empty grid. --}}
{{#get "posts" filter="visibility:-public" limit="3" include="tags,authors" as |locked|}}
	{{#if locked}}
		<section
			aria-labelledby="locked-h"
			class="container pt-20">
			<h2
				id="locked-h"
				class="font-ui text-muted border-border mb-6 border-b pb-3.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase">{{t "Behind the paywall right now"}}</h2>

			<div class="grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(280px,100%),1fr))] gap-6">
				{{#foreach locked}}
					<article class="{{post_class}} border-border bg-surface flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-md border">
						<a
							href="{{url}}"
							class="text-text flex h-full flex-col no-underline">
							{{#if feature_image}}
								<img
									src="{{img_url feature_image size="m"}}"
									{{#if feature_image_alt}}alt="{{feature_image_alt}}"{{else}}alt=""{{/if}}
									loading="lazy"
									decoding="async"
									class="border-border block aspect-video w-full border-b object-cover">
							{{/if}}

							<div class="flex flex-auto flex-col gap-2.5 p-5">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
									{{#primary_tag}}
										<span class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-accent uppercase">{{name}}</span>
									{{/primary_tag}}

									{{> "tier-chip"}}
								</div>

								<h3 class="font-display tracking-heading text-[19px] leading-[1.26] font-medium">{{title}}</h3>

								<p class="font-meta text-meta tracking-meta text-muted mt-auto uppercase">
									{{~#if authors}}{{> "byline"}}<span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>{{/if~}}
									{{> "dateline"}}
								</p>
							</div>
						</a>
					</article>
				{{/foreach}}
			</div>
		</section>
	{{/if}}
{{/get}}
